<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>洁家家政 - 在线预约</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #2980b9;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
